How to build optee-test.

The following commands need to be run from a Debian-based ARM64 system. Please see ../README for details.


First build optee-os

./run.sh optee-os


Then build optee-client
./run.sh optee-client

Then install packages that were created as part of optee-client

dpkg -i build/trixie/optee-client/libteec2_4.7.0+git20250611+23c112a-1_arm64.deb
dpkg -i build/trixie/optee-client/libckteec0t64_4.7.0+git20250611+23c112a-1_arm64.deb
dpkg -i build/trixie/optee-client/libseteec0t64_4.7.0+git20250611+23c112a-1_arm64.deb
dpkg -i build/trixie/optee-client/libteeacl0.1.0t64_4.7.0+git20250611+23c112a-1_arm64.deb
dpkg -i build/trixie/optee-client/tee-supplicant_4.7.0+git20250611+23c112a-1_arm64.deb
dpkg -i build/trixie/optee-client/optee-client-dev_4.7.0+git20250611+23c112a-1_arm64.deb

Also install packages that were created as part of optee-os:

dpkg -i build/trixie/optee-os/optee-os-dev_4.7.0+git20250807+a9690ae-1_arm64.deb

Then build optee-test

./run.sh optee-test


The resulting Debian package will be called optee-test-k3.
It has compatibility for the complete K3 platform (e.g. VAR-SOM-AM62, VAR-SOM-AM62P)
Its name helps to distinguish optee-test for AM62 and optee-test-qemu which is provided
by Trixie directly.


All *.deb packages mentioned need to provided as part of the Variscite PPA:

ls build/trixie/optee-*/*.deb
build/trixie/optee-client/libckteec0t64-dbgsym_4.7.0+git20250611+23c112a-1_arm64.deb
build/trixie/optee-client/libckteec0t64_4.7.0+git20250611+23c112a-1_arm64.deb
build/trixie/optee-client/libseteec0t64-dbgsym_4.7.0+git20250611+23c112a-1_arm64.deb
build/trixie/optee-client/libseteec0t64_4.7.0+git20250611+23c112a-1_arm64.deb
build/trixie/optee-client/libteeacl0.1.0t64-dbgsym_4.7.0+git20250611+23c112a-1_arm64.deb
build/trixie/optee-client/libteeacl0.1.0t64_4.7.0+git20250611+23c112a-1_arm64.deb
build/trixie/optee-client/libteec2-dbgsym_4.7.0+git20250611+23c112a-1_arm64.deb
build/trixie/optee-client/libteec2_4.7.0+git20250611+23c112a-1_arm64.deb
build/trixie/optee-client/optee-client-dev_4.7.0+git20250611+23c112a-1_arm64.deb
build/trixie/optee-client/tee-supplicant-dbgsym_4.7.0+git20250611+23c112a-1_arm64.deb
build/trixie/optee-client/tee-supplicant_4.7.0+git20250611+23c112a-1_arm64.deb
build/trixie/optee-os/optee-os-dev_4.7.0+git20250807+a9690ae-1_arm64.deb
build/trixie/optee-test/optee-test-k3-dbgsym_4.7.0+git20250616+a15be9e-1_arm64.deb
build/trixie/optee-test/optee-test-k3_4.7.0+git20250616+a15be9e-1_arm64.deb


This will provide all OP TEE related packages in the version matching the 11.02.08 release.
This means the TEE support libraries are in newer versions than provided by Debian Trixie
for OPTEE on qemu.
